        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Major League Baseball Players' Association, Major League Baseball\n- People: Mark McGwire, Jose Canseco, Marvin Miller\n- Awards: Marvin Miller Man of the Year Award\n- Topics: Bash Brothers\n\nFacts:\n- In 1997, the Major League Baseball Players' Association created the Man of the Year Award and presented it to the inaugural winner, Mark McGwire.\n- The Man of the Year Award is the award later known as the Marvin Miller Man of the Year Award.\n- Mark McGwire, born on October 1, 1963, is nicknamed Big Mac.\n- Mark McGwire is an American former professional baseball player and currently a bench coach in Major League Baseball.\n- The Bash Brothers are a duo of former baseball players consisting of Jose Canseco and Mark McGwire.",
